OL,3,GNEWSADad's 'guilt' after passing on
OL,4,Agenetic cancer risk
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's not what you want to do as a
OL,7,Fparent. It's the last thing you want to
OL,8,Fdo."
OL,10,FHarjit Singh Nijjer said when he
OL,11,Fdiscovered he had inherited a genetic
OL,12,Fcondition he immediately began to worry
OL,13,Fabout potentially passing it on to his
OL,14,Fson.
OL,16,FHarjit, of Market Harborough in
OL,17,FLeicestershire, was 48 when he was
OL,18,Fdiagnosed with bowel cancer.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
