OL,3,GNEWSADad's 'guilt' after passing on
OL,4,Agenetic cancer risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter undergoing surgery and
OL,7,Fchemotherapy, he found out he had
OL,8,Finherited Lynch syndrome - a condition
OL,9,Fthat increases the risk of certain
OL,10,Fcancers, including bowel, ovarian and
OL,11,Fpancreatic.
